Package: tstsqa
Type: Package
Title: Bias Reduction for Two-Sample Two-Stage (TSTS) Imputation via Quantile Adjustment
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Pedro", "J. Torres-Lopez", email = "p.torres-lopez@lse.ac.uk",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Implements the quantile adjustment method for correcting variance
    bias and covariance bias in two-sample two-stage (TSTS) survey-to-survey
    imputation, as described in Torres-Lopez, "Bias Reduction in TSTSLS
    Applications: A Quantile Adjustment Method." Provides a function to
    construct and apply the quantile-gap adjustment to a target sample
    ('qa_fit'), and a function implementing the paper's
    bootstrap-based predictor screening, cross-validated model selection,
    and regime diagnostic ('qa_diagnose').
